WEBVTT

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:11.330
Taiyo!

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.950
Father?!

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.950
"Yuki"

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.250
Stop it!

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.660
You made it here with your physical body...

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.200
Bastard...

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:19.950
"AFTERLOST"

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:25.950
"Episode 12: Future"

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:30.410
Akira...

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:36.700
Miss Yuki. The strength of
your will is everything here.

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:39.540
Keep your will strong.

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:54.750
You cannot escape, Daichi.

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:57.950
We have no time.

00:02:57.950 --> 00:03:00.700
I must make the Lost complete.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:02.580
Don't joke around!

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:08.660
Do you realize... how many people
have already been sacrificed?!

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:12.540
A few tens of thousands. Not enough at all.

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:17.700
Daichi! Come out.

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:21.450
You want to stop the Lost that badly, do you?

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:26.250
We are trying to save our world.
Isn't that right?

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:33.250
Think of all our suffering comrades.
What is giving you doubt?

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.000
That thing?

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.870
The result of a mistake.

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:44.950
I will erase it, along with your doubt.

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.370
What are you doing?

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:59.580
The medicine should still be working!

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:02.200
"You still don't understand?"

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:08.620
"That is because you are alone."

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:14.120
Taiyo?

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:18.080
See. I remember you properly!

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:25.660
Maintaining your existence from
continual mutual confirmation, huh?

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:27.790
How heroic.

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:33.580
However, compared to what I
must shoulder, it is so very weak.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:38.200
"How sad, Taiyo."

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:44.540
Father...

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:50.700
"You worked hard."

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:56.700
Why did you call Yuki to Lost?

00:04:56.700 --> 00:05:00.370
Was it necessary to make her suffer like this?

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:06.250
"There is something that only she can do."

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:10.870
"There is something that only she can do."
"Yuki can choose universes."

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:29.870
Choose...

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:32.910
Choose universes?

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:38.660
"Yuki, you are an existence
that bridges two universes."

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:42.910
"In other words,
you are the Observer."

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:45.700
Observer?

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:51.160
"You have the ability to do everything over."

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:20.250
Souma, do you have your lunch box?

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:21.870
I do!

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:23.250
Yuki!

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:26.250
Goodness, how long do you
plan to worry about your hair?

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:27.910
You're going to be late!

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:29.580
Yeah...

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:35.200
So, Yuki has reached that age.

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:39.660
I'm off!

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:43.160
Then, please take care them
today as well, Mr. Akira.

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:45.290
Leave them to me.

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:49.080
Man, tests are such a pain...

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:51.290
Don't talk like that.

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:54.500
You should have no problems as long
as you pay attention in class.

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:56.910
Miss Yuki has good grades, after all.

00:06:56.910 --> 00:07:00.750
Huh? Akira, are you trying to say I'm stupid?!

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:02.660
Not at all, Mister Souma.

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:05.250
I just haven't gotten serious, yet.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:07.790
Then, get serious.

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:09.040
Maybe someday!

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:09.870
"President Under Arrest: Lacuna Chemical Laboratory
Under Suspicion of Human Experimentation"

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:13.910
"President Under Arrest: Lacuna Chemical Laboratory
Under Suspicion of Human Experimentation"
Any moment now, the car housing the
president of Lacuna chemical will drive by!

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:15.580
Here they are!

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:20.500
The president and vice-president of
Lacuna Chemical have been charged

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:24.620
with using children from an orphanage
for evil and cruel human experimentation.

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:27.830
--Since the suspects are facing downwards,
we cannot discern their expressions.

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:28.370
--You did well, Takuya.
--Since the suspects are facing downwards,
we cannot discern their expressions.

00:07:28.370 --> 00:07:31.160
--You did well, Takuya.
--I repeat, the president and
vice-president of Lacuna Chemical

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:34.040
--Thank you very much.
--have been charged with using
children from an orphanage

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:36.870
--Children that had nowhere to go...
--for evil and cruel human experimentation.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:38.290
--Unforgivable.
--for evil and cruel human experimentation.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:39.410
--The video we are about to show is of Lacuna...

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:42.500
--I told you I didn't want any green peas, Mom!
--The video we are about to show is of Lacuna...

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:43.950
It's not good to be picky.

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:47.120
What about Dad?! What about Dad?!

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:48.410
"Yoshiaki"

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:50.450
"Yoshiaki"
Come in.

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:52.250
It's almost time.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.080
Oh, yes.

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:59.750
What's wrong? Are you nervous?

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:03.330
Aren't you a magician?

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:06.370
You have to always keep your cool.

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:10.410
Brother! Where have you been until now?!

00:08:10.410 --> 00:08:15.830
Thanks to all of you, we are finally
able to stand upon this stage.

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:19.870
The five of us were able
to reach this stage together!

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:24.250
I can't imagine failing from here on out!

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:28.160
We will continue running forward at top speed.

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:32.450
Keep up and make sure you don't fall behind.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:36.870
The salty Haruka blew a kiss?!
What in the world is happening?!

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:39.950
I've decided to make this
year a year of challenges.

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:42.080
What are your aspirations this year, Rena?

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:46.410
Aspirations? Oh, to no longer be called clumsy!

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:48.370
Rena, stay just the way you are.

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:51.700
Huh? Then Yua should keep the devious role!

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:54.500
Hey, now. All of you!

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:57.080
Well, that's what everyone says,

00:08:57.080 --> 00:09:01.080
but there are times when even
I wet my pillow with tears.

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:06.370
But, during the good times and
the bad times, everyone was here.

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:11.200
Because of everyone here, I felt
like things would turn out okay.

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:14.620
Thank you all...

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:17.200
Yua-<i>tan</i>!

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:22.120
"Police Commissioner Award Ceremony"

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:32.160
Once again, congratulations on the police
commissioner award. You did well.

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:35.120
No, it is thanks to all of you.

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:38.620
Congratulations, Dad. Er, Officer Negishi.

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:41.950
I can't believe you took down Lacuna.

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:44.750
It was a case you were chasing for many years.

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:46.160
How about a drink tonight?

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:48.160
There are still other crimes being committed.

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:50.580
We're going get even busier here on out.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:51.700
Yes!

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:55.750
I'm home.

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:57.040
Huh?

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:06.790
Happy birthday to you! Happy birthday to you!

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:11.540
Happy birthday dear Yuki...

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:20.080
"This is the true happiness
that should have occurred."

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:23.160
"This is the true happiness
that should have occurred."
"You are the only one who can choose"

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:24.160
"You are the only one who can choose"

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:29.660
"You are the only one who can choose"
"such a possibility."

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:36.000
"Now, choose."

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:40.790
"Now, choose."
"For all the people."

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:49.790
I won't... I won't choose.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:57.120
Of course, I think it would be better
if the Lost never happened.

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:59.580
But, it happened.

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:04.370
And we continued to live in this world...

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:08.700
These last three years,
everyone lived on so desperately.

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:14.450
One day, people dear to
them suddenly disappeared.

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:22.660
They didn't know why, but they
worked hard to move forward.

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:27.410
There are lives that were
born after the Lost, too.

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:34.660
If I choose one universe, it means
I reject the existence of the other.

00:11:36.950 --> 00:11:40.500
I can't do something like that...

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:45.790
"Yuki, I did this for you."

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:51.080
So many things happened up until now.

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:56.410
It was hard and painful,
but it wasn't just that.

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:05.250
We pulled together, worked together,
and got a little stronger.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:17.410
No matter what, we will continue forward.

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:25.200
The possibilities are always...
only in the future.

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:32.750
The Lost happened.

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:37.910
But, I will continue living...

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:41.700
...in this world.

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:54.540
Father, thank you. But, we aren't that weak.

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:11.790
What was that just now?!

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:16.080
A huge burst of gravitational
waves are occurring near Lost.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:18.540
What's happening inside?

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:19.870
Takuya!

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:23.910
It's coming from Lost!

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:26.200
But we can't get any closer.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.410
Shit!

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:33.700
Daichi...

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.370
Enough of your boastful dribble.

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:44.830
I will eliminate you completely
and complete the Lost.

00:13:46.370 --> 00:13:52.330
I am connected to the future
of millions of people.

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:55.660
Stop it!

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.370
Yuki!

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:13.290
This is the end!

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:52.160
Did you think I wouldn't be able
to predict something like this?

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:08.790
Damn Suzuna...!

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:11.250
She predicted things this far...

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:19.200
"Failure"

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:32.620
Miss Yuki...

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:34.870
Miss Yuki!

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:36.330
This is your chance!

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:42.000
Use that against Taiyo...

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:54.500
Takuya.

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:24.000
Get on the scooter. Yuki! Takuya!

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:39.870
Yuki, you've gotten so big...

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:10.620
Jack, just now...

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:12.160
Yeah.

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:16.830
Hey, that's...

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:23.580
Wake up! Hang in there!

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:25.160
Where's Takuya?!

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:27.120
Yuki!

00:17:27.120 --> 00:17:30.000
Takuya!

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:40.500
Now, making this tree...

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:46.410
...disappear isn't very nice, so I'll
make this plastic bottle disappear.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:50.040
One. Two. Three.

00:17:51.660 --> 00:17:54.000
Wow! Did you see that just now?

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:58.000
Thank you very much! Thank you very much!

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.910
Yes. Of course!

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:04.830
Investigating your husband's cheating
habits will start from 100,000 yen a day.

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:07.580
Hey!

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:11.160
I want to do jobs that are more exciting.

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:11.450
"Hidaka Detective Agency"

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:15.370
"Hidaka Detective Agency"
Don't be picky about the jobs!
Or just go back to the police force!

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:18.580
"Hidaka Detective Agency"
I would have already gone back if I could.

00:18:18.580 --> 00:18:19.080
"Lost Countermeasure Project Team Establishment"

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:26.450
"Lost Countermeasure Project Team Establishment"
In other words, even now, the problem of the
Lost is something that effects all of mankind.

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:31.620
So, our foundation has decided
to create a project team.

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:35.370
We are recruiting any talent,
no matter the country or race,

00:18:35.370 --> 00:18:38.290
that can help us overcome
this difficult problem.

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:04.410
"Kikyo"
"We're going to be late tonight,
so go ahead and eat dinner without us."

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:06.450
"Yuki"
"Okay!"
"Jump"

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:16.330
How is Yuki lately?

00:19:17.410 --> 00:19:21.000
She's slowly gotten used to daily life.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:25.120
Though, she's always mumbling
that studying is hard.

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:29.910
And her memories?

00:19:29.910 --> 00:19:36.830
Yes. It seems she doesn't remember the
existence of a courier named Takuya.

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:41.910
She was exposed to the surge particles too long.

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:49.700
Yuki!

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:52.830
We go in the same direction for a while.

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:54.790
Oh, yeah.

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:56.910
Are you keeping up with class?

00:19:56.910 --> 00:20:00.080
Hmm. Barely, I guess?

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:04.000
Ask me if you hit any problems.
I'll lend you my notes.

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:05.950
Yeah. Thank you.

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:15.790
What's wrong?

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:19.040
Nothing...

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:23.620
So tough!

00:20:23.620 --> 00:20:26.500
Quite pathetic for someone so young!

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:32.080
I didn't think it'd be this much manual labor.

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:38.540
So, we still don't know where he is?

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:42.370
Oh, yes...

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:47.250
Thanks for the treat!

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:52.700
We should definitely brand this tomato!

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:55.950
Let's think of a plan to distribute
this throughout the country.

00:20:55.950 --> 00:21:00.000
No, no. I'm raising them as a hobby.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.370
Welp, I need to head out soon.

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:04.750
You still have work left here, right?

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:06.870
What?!

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:46.950
"Thank you for watching!!
See you again, somewhere!!"
"From the Staff of AFTERLOST"
"Shigeyuki Miya"
